        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "You can select the Devastator Doctrine an additional time each battle. Your ADEPTUS ASTARTES units' ranged attacks that target an enemy unit within 12\" have +1S. If your army includes VULKAN HE'STAN, your INFERNUS SQUADs can Advance/Fall Back and still perform an action that turn, and when INFERNUS SQUADs perform an action they can still shoot in the Shooting phase that turn.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Blazing Earth (1CP)",
        "id": "50a2-8549-3913-8a8b",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: At the start of your opponent's Charge phase\nTARGET: An enemy unit within 12\" of a [TORRENT]/[MELTA] Adeptus Astartes unit\nEFFECT: Target one enemy unit within 12\" of your [TORRENT]/[MELTA] Adeptus Astartes unit and give it -1 to Charge rolls this phase.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Forged in Fire (1CP)",
        "id": "3b58-1ca9-5890-bde5",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: During your Shooting phase, when your engaged Adeptus Astartes unit is selected to shoot\nTARGET: An engaged Adeptus Astartes unit\nEFFECT: Remove [BLAST] from the unit's ranged attacks and give it [CLOSE-QUARTERS] and +1A.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Burning Vengeance (1CP)",
        "id": "bf96-32f0-719c-d03b",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: During your opponent's Shooting phase, when your Adeptus Astartes Transport unit was shot\nTARGET: A unit embarked in the shot transport\nEFFECT: An embarked unit can make a disembark move and shoot at the enemy unit which targeted the transport using normal shooting.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
