          "$text": "WHEN: During your Shooting phase, when your Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit is selected to attack\nTARGET: An Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit\nEFFECT: Give the unit's [TORRENT] weapons +1AP.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
